OL,3,GNEWSA'I turned my pain into purpose to
OL,4,Abecome a beauty queen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShuffled between houses and struggling
OL,7,Fto find stability, the idea of becoming
OL,8,Fa beauty queen was an outlandish
OL,9,Fambition for Charlotte Levy.
OL,11,FHer background in care ` which saw her
OL,12,Fmove placements nine times during her
OL,13,FA-levels alone ` was short on glitz and
OL,14,Fglamour.
OL,16,FBut instead of hiding her story, Levy,
OL,17,F24, decided to embrace it.
